    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing Crystal Rail - a unique, handpainted, Rail-Rogue RPG,\u00a0featuring voice work by youtuber <u>TheOtherFrost</u> and music by acclaimed composer <u>Jordan Chin</u> <i>(Monster Train).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/7eca1636a872b8f026a7f3957c1bd6e5.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/7eca1636a872b8f026a7f3957c1bd6e5.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Crystalpunk Train</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/f47b7f56ff32c2facd6872ff559f9b18.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/f47b7f56ff32c2facd6872ff559f9b18.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a hand painted world...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/fb47d534f20b40e8fbc30583338b3410.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/fb47d534f20b40e8fbc30583338b3410.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Steeped in Greed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the strategy-roguelike - a train game with a one-of-a-kind aesthetic - A revolutionary RPG set in a Crystalpunk world!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong>! And join our discord for all the latest announcements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/13937427e613f6d4f96152614cb47758.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=780 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/13937427e613f6d4f96152614cb47758.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing Crystal Rail - a unique, handpainted, Rail-Rogue RPG,\u00a0featuring voice work by youtuber <u>TheOtherFrost</u> and music by acclaimed composer <u>Jordan Chin</u> <i>(Monster Train).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/7eca1636a872b8f026a7f3957c1bd6e5.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/7eca1636a872b8f026a7f3957c1bd6e5.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a Crystalpunk Train</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/f47b7f56ff32c2facd6872ff559f9b18.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/f47b7f56ff32c2facd6872ff559f9b18.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a hand painted world...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/fb47d534f20b40e8fbc30583338b3410.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=600 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/fb47d534f20b40e8fbc30583338b3410.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Steeped in Greed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new take on the strategy-roguelike - a train game with a one-of-a-kind aesthetic - A revolutionary RPG set in a Crystalpunk world!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong>! And join our discord for all the latest announcements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/13937427e613f6d4f96152614cb47758.poster.avif?t=1755233988\" width=780 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359330/extras/13937427e613f6d4f96152614cb47758.webm?t=1755233988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p>",
